          "title": "Chronological timeline",
          "bullets": [
            {
              "id": "2a.1",
              "text": "A warning was issued for the terraces on March 14 at 07:23 UTC, followed by evacuation of about 60 households from Withel terraces and Cranmoor; the lower road was damaged and service disrupted at the mine and benches, with road restoration reported by March 19 at 12:16 UTC.",
